###


# @name getProducts
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
?getFavorites=true
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# @name addProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Wireless Phone Charger",
    "scrape_interval": "2 minutes",
